166	# Register the kept OAuth custom routes via FastMCP. The
167	# /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource route is mounted natively by
168	# RemoteAuthProvider at the suffix-scoped path
169	# (/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource/mcp). The authorization-server
170	# metadata mirror and /revoke remain custom_routes because
171	# RemoteAuthProvider doesn't provide them. After this migration there is
172	# no Starlette middleware doing auth, so custom_route no longer represents
173	# the bypass surface.
